---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ImageGallery from '../../components/ImageGallery.astro';
import showcaseData from '../../data/showcases/rome-summer.json';
---

<PageLayout title="Rome Summer" description="Observing Rome at its most unforgiving">
  <article class="project">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="project-header">
        <h1 class="project-title">Rome Summer / Roman Holiday</h1>
        <p class="project-tagline">Observing Rome at its most unforgiving</p>
      </header>

      <div class="project-hero">
        <div class="video-wrapper">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gu7WH5eK34E"
            title="Rome Summer - Visual Journey"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
            class="hero-video"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-content">
        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What it is</h2>
          <p>
            A short cinematic visual project observing Rome at its most unforgiving. Set during
            peak summer, it focuses on heat, stillness, and human behavior under pressure—capturing
            the city not as a postcard, but as a place you endure before you appreciate.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>What problem it solves</h2>
          <p>
            Rome is usually portrayed as eternally romantic and effortlessly charming. This project
            pushes back on that fantasy, showing the friction: the oppressive sun, the slowed pace,
            the small coping rituals. It reframes the city as something lived in, not consumed.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Approach & methods</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Narrative-driven visual sequencing rather than standalone shots</li>
            <li>Controlled, intentional camera movement</li>
            <li>High-contrast daylight and hard shadows as storytelling tools</li>
            <li>Voiceover used as commentary, not explanation</li>
            <li>Mood-first pacing over informational structure</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Tools</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Image generation: Nano Banana Pro</li>
            <li>Video generation: Veo 3.1 and Kling 2.6</li>
            <li>Editing & pacing: CapCut</li>
            <li>Voice-over generation: ElevenLabs</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>

      <!-- Image Gallery Showcase -->
      <ImageGallery
        showcaseData={showcaseData}
        showCaptions={true}
        captionPosition="below"
      />
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    padding-top: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 10rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .project-hero {
    margin-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 aspect ratio */
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .hero-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
  }

  .project-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .content-section ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .content-section li {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .content-section li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }
</style>
